045500         10  SRF-MPLTINFO-PRIME    PIC X(3).
045600         10  SRF-MPLTINFO-TERR     PIC X(4).
045700         10  SRF-MPLTINFO-PLT-NAME PIC X(50).
045800     05  SRF-SPOOL-PRT-NO          PIC S9(2) COMP-4.
045900     05  SRF-FIRST-TIME-SW         PIC X(1).
046000     05  SRF-CALL-COUNT            PIC 9(1).
046100     05  SRF-ENTER-FLAG            PIC X(1).
046200     05  SRF-CURSOR-FLD            PIC 9(3).
           05  SRF-ERROR-FLD             PIC S9(4) BINARY.
           05  SRF-INDICATORS.
               10  IND OCCURS 99 TIMES   PIC 1 INDICATOR 01.
