050500     05  FILLER                PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
050600     05  FILLER                PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
050700     05  FILLER                PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
050800     05  FILLER                PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
050900     05  FILLER                PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
051000     05  VIEW-RETRIES          PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
051100     05  VIEW-OPTIONS          PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
051200     05  VIEW-TERMLDEV         PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
051300     05  VIEW-USERTIME         PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
051400     05  VIEW-IDENTIFIER       PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
